    "title": "Brett Larrick resigns as Elyria boys basketball coach - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Matt Goul, cleveland.com ,\n7 hours ago ELYRIA, Ohio — Brett Larrick is not returning as Elyria’s boys basketball coach. The school announced Wednesday that Larrick has resigned, which the coach confirmed later in the day. His decision follows one of the program’s deepest tournament runs in school history, making it to the OHSAA Division I regional finals. Read full article",
